=== exact-tenths
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 0.1 + 0.2 - 0.3 is zero
    A  0.1 EUR
    A  0.2 EUR
    B  -0.3 EUR
2024-01-03 ten tenths make one
    A  0.1 EUR
    A  0.1 EUR
    A  0.1 EUR
    A  0.1 EUR
    A  0.1 EUR
    A  0.1 EUR
    A  0.1 EUR
    A  0.1 EUR
    A  0.1 EUR
    A  0.1 EUR
    B  -1 EUR
--- out
OK
=== exact-large
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 large values do not lose cents
    A  9999999999.99 EUR
    A  9999999999.99 EUR
    A  0.02 EUR
    B  -9999999999 EUR
    B  -9999999999 EUR
    B  -2 EUR
2024-01-03 off by a millionth
    A  1234567890.123456 EUR
    B  -1234567890.123455 EUR
--- out
10: UNBALANCED
=== unbalanced-tiny
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 off by a millionth
    A  0.000001 EUR
    B  0 EUR
--- out
3: UNBALANCED
=== unbalanced-two-commodities
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 two commodities, one error
    A  1 EUR
    A  1 USD
    B  -2 EUR
--- out
3: UNBALANCED
=== commodities-balance-separately
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 EUR and USD do not cancel
    A  1 EUR
    B  -1 USD
--- out
3: UNBALANCED
=== multi-elided-three
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-01 open C
2024-01-02 three
    A  1 EUR
    B
    C
    A
