OK
=== elided-zero-residual-ok
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-01 open C
2024-01-02 nothing left for C
    A  1 EUR
    B  -1 EUR
    C
--- out
OK
=== single-elided-alone
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-02 only an elided posting
    A
--- out
OK
=== open-after-posting
--- args
check
--- in
2024-03-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-02-01 before A opens
    A  1 EUR
    B
2024-03-01 the day A opens
    A  1 EUR
    B
--- out
4: NOT_OPEN
=== open-is-exact-account
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food:Fruit
2024-01-01 open Equity
2024-01-02 parent open, child not
    Assets:Cash  5 EUR
    Equity
2024-01-03 child open, parent not
    Expenses:Food  5 EUR
    Expenses:Food:Fruit  5 EUR
    Equity
--- out
5: NOT_OPEN
8: NOT_OPEN
=== closed-after-close
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-06-30 close A
2024-06-30 on the close date
    A  1 EUR
    B
2024-07-01 after the close date
    A  1 EUR
    B
2024-07-02 the elided posting is checked too
    B  1 EUR
    A
--- out
8: CLOSED
12: CLOSED
=== close-before-open-is-not-open
--- args
check
--- in
2024-05-01 open A
2024-03-01 close A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-04-01 between close and open
    A  1 EUR
    B
2024-02-01 before both
    A  1 EUR
    B
2024-06-01 after both
    A  1 EUR
    B
--- out
5: NOT_OPEN
8: NOT_OPEN
11: CLOSED
=== close-without-open
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-01 close A
2024-02-01 never opened
    A  1 EUR
    B
--- out
4: NOT_OPEN
=== duplicate-directives
--- args
check
--- in
2024-02-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-01 open A
2024-12-01 close A
2024-06-01 close A
2024-01-15 the first open (Feb) applies
    A  1 EUR
    B
2024-07-01 the first close (Dec) applies
    A  1 EUR
    B
--- out
3: DUPLICATE
5: DUPLICATE
7: NOT_OPEN
=== directive-bad-date-ignored
--- args
check
--- in
2024-02-30 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-03-01 A was never opened
    A  1 EUR
    B
--- out
1: BAD_DATE
4: NOT_OPEN
=== directives-by-date-not-file-order
--- args
check
--- in
