=== every-account-error-reported
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open C
2024-01-31 close C
2024-02-01 X and Y never opened, C closed
    X  1 EUR
    A  -1 EUR
    Y  2 EUR
    C  -2 EUR
--- out
5: NOT_OPEN
7: NOT_OPEN
8: CLOSED
=== errors-in-file-order
